  },
  "longest_row_tokens": "The longest row of the run's training file under the Qwen3 chat template, counted with the model's tokenizer (the data is not shipped). With batch 2 the longest micro-batch the collator can build is 2 x this, because it pads to the longest row of the micro-batch. null with fills_max_length: every row is at least max_length tokens, so every micro-batch is batch x max_length.",
